Package: convertoor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Caleb Trueman <calebtrueman@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/calebtrueman/convertoor
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, ffmpeg, imagemagick, pandoc, poppler-utils, librsvg2-bin
Recommends: libreoffice-writer, libreoffice-calc, libreoffice-impress, libreoffice-draw, python3-yaml, python3-fonttools, python3-brotli, libheif-examples, 7zip | p7zip-full
Suggests: calibre, texlive-xetex
Description: Drag-and-drop file converter
 Convertoor converts images, audio, video, documents, spreadsheets,
 presentations, ebooks, archives, fonts and data files between formats.
 Drop files on the window, pick a format and press Convert.
 .
 It drives FFmpeg, ImageMagick, Pandoc, LibreOffice, Poppler, librsvg,
 libheif, Calibre and fontTools, chaining them automatically when needed.
